# Conclusion & Lead Candidate Identification
By combining binding affinity with automated toxicity filtering, the pipeline successfully isolated ligand_5281034 as the ultimate lead candidate. It achieved the highest overall binding affinity (-9.865 kcal/mol) while maintaining a flawless ADMET safety profile (0 Lipinski violations, non-toxic, highly absorbable). This demo confirms the pipeline is highly robust, scalable, and ready for large-scale virtual screening campaigns.
